{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116515","id":3305563644,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7FBuX8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116515","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116515.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116515.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116515","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116515/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116515/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116515/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7d6d11f8d8a6c39d8077fe80937e5c000d1f832c","number":116515,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix EditorSettings error due to `android_sdk_path` when exporting a project","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This editor setting is queried once every 3 seconds, as it is used to check whether devices have been (dis)connected for one-click deploy.\r\n\r\nThis method may be called early on depending on initialization order, which has led to occasional error messages when exporting a project. The method now returns early if EditorSettings isn't ready yet (it will be called again soon after anyway).\r\n\r\nThis should fix spurious CI failures that have occurred since https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109146 was merged.\r\n\r\nPS: It seems we're performing the `adb devices` polling even when the editor isn't currently focused. This wastes CPU, as the user can't interact with the one-click deploy dropdown if they aren't currently focused on the editor. We should probably early return if we are currently not focused, but I figure I'd leave this to a future PR as to avoid any possible regression here.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith